{"severity":"error","file":"errors/division_by_zero_1.march","start_line":34,"start_col":18,"end_line":34,"end_col":25,"message":"division by `n` in `cap no_panic` module may be by zero — no refinement proves `n ≠ 0`.\n\nUse `Math.checked_div` or `Math.checked_mod` to return `Option(Int)` instead of panicking, or annotate the divisor parameter with `{v : Int | v != 0}` (or `v > 0`) to prove it is safe.","code":"division_by_zero","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"REFINEMENT"}
